synopsis: "Pure OCaml Tron SDK for clients and signers"
description: """
The offline surface: types, crypto, generated wire bindings, transaction
construction and the typed RPC protocol. Transports are deliberately absent --
tron-rpc-flow and tron-rpc-unix are separate packages so that a consumer
linking this one takes on no Lwt, no Unix and no socket."""
